        "Here are the room's baked cells, drawn as one point each"}}.

${over {' {cellViewRange 0.0 4.0}} {overText {' {cutHeightRange 1.4 2.4}} "Each cell stores light"}}.

${overText
    {' {octreeLevelRange 7.0 5.0}}
    "Each bigger cell up the octree stores a blend of the eight smaller cells inside it"}.

${cue "key" {'
